# Prerequisites
*.d

# Precompiled Headers
*.gch
*.pch

# Compiled Dynamic libraries
*.so
*.dylib
# 如果你的 bin 資料夾需要依賴 dll 才能執行，且你不打算讓人自己編譯 dll，可能需要註解掉下面這行
*.dll

# Fortran module files
*.mod
*.smod

# Compiled Static libraries
*.lai
*.la
*.a
# 下面這行會忽略所有 .lib 檔。如果你有必要的第三方 lib 需要上傳，請用 git add -f 強制加入，或是在這裡註解掉
*.lib

# Executables
*.exe
*.out
*.app

# Release
*.tar
*.zip

# Build Directories (CMake & VS)
build/
bin/
x64/
Debug/
Release/

# CMake generated files (in case you ran cmake in root)
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
Makefile

# Visual Studio (Code)
.vs/
# .vscode 通常建議上傳 tasks.json/launch.json 方便協作，但如果你不想上傳個人設定，可以忽略
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo
*.sln
*.vcxproj
*.vcxproj.filters

# ImGui configuration
imgui.ini

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db